      "value": "another idea would be more/unlimited Friend groups (stored locally to not have a impact on the API and in a file you can backup).\n\nThat way you could sort your friends in whatever way you want. \n\nThe 3 friend Groups are not enough. And then when clicking on someone, the friend group they are in should be visibly represented in their page on the small menu.\n\nThe next step would be to be able to give the group a color that will then be represented on the nametag.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
